<p>The picture that emerges from the full combine profile is precise: <strong>Brunson is extremely small, has very short arms, jumps well for his size, and moves laterally at an elite level.</strong> The two things combine testing measures well — size and length — say he should not be a quality NBA starter. The two things it measures poorly — technical skill and basketball IQ — happen to be where Brunson is exceptional.</p>
